artifact.wake-of-gods.artifacts.dragonhe:
{Dragonheart}

This ancient relic summons [40 + 20*SP] HP Red Dragons for the duration of a battle (summoning starts from 8-9 SP).
In addition, dragons in a hero's army always have positive morale.

